      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Currently, save files are split into four separate files in your save
    data directory. Beta 0.6 will consolidate them into one single file.


    Along
    with everything being in one convenient file, the location of your save data
    will change too due to some technical reasons.


    This version of the game
    (0.5.2) will be the last update to officially support your save data as it currently
    exists.


    If you don''t want to lose your current save file, have no fear!
    Just go to the next page and I''ll explain how to update your save file!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
